pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
notes: |
  这页要把普通 GNSS 和 RTK 彻底分开。ATGM336H 的软件适配已经完成，但硬件能力不满足 0.5 米指标；目前 RTK 采购、差分服务和融合链路都没有完成证据。
elements:
  - elementId: p6-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [58, 32, 840, 34]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      text: ATGM336H 只能做普通 GNSS，RTK 精定位链路尚未启动
  - elementId: p6-meta
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 70, 840, 20]
    content:
      style: "$muted"
      text: 当前模块：NMEA 解析 + ROS 2 发布；目标模块：多频 RTK + 差分 + 全局融合
  - elementId: p6-rule
    elementType: line
    bounds: [60, 98, 840, 2]
    viewBox: [1, 1]
    points: "0,0.5 1,0.5"
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 2
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: p6-table
    elementType: table
    bounds: [60, 130, 585, 270]
    columnWidths: [0.22, 0.39, 0.39]
    rowHeights: [0.17, 0.17, 0.17, 0.17, 0.16, 0.16]
    style: "$default"
    rows:
      - - text: "维度"
        - text: "当前 ATGM336H"
        - text: "比赛级目标"
      - - text: "定位"
        - text: "单频单点 GNSS"
        - text: "多频 RTK Float/Fix"
      - - text: "差分"
        - text: "无 RTCM / CORS 链路"
        - text: "CORS/NTRIP 或自建基站"
      - - text: "航向"
        - text: "普通 NMEA 航向"
        - text: "双天线或稳定融合航向"
      - - text: "软件"
        - text: "GGA/GLL/VTG、/fix、ENU"
        - text: "RTK 状态、质量和全局融合"
      - - text: "串口"
        - text: "/dev/ttyUSB0；9600 baud"
        - text: "需与雷达分配专用串口"
  - elementId: p6-conclusion-mark
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [690, 148, 10, 122]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: p6-conclusion
    elementType: text
    bounds: [720, 145, 180, 132]
    content:
      style: "$section"
      fontSize: 20
      lineHeight: 1.35
      text: |
        当前结论

        普通 GNSS 软件包已完成，
        但不能证明
        定位误差 < 0.5 m。
  - elementId: p6-bottom-rule
    elementType: line
    bounds: [60, 424, 840, 2]
    viewBox: [1, 1]
    points: "0,0.5 1,0.5"
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 2
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: p6-bottom
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 440, 840, 36]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: 下一步：先确定 RTK 接收机、天线、差分服务和独立真值方案，再做现场接入与融合误差统计。
  - elementId: p6-page
    elementType: text
    bounds: [850, 492, 50, 18]
    content:
      style: "$muted"
      align: [right, top]
      text: 06 / 11

